ndings to be fixed as well. No release was\nrequested.\n\n## Implementation evidence\n\nFindings, corrections and the tests that pin them are tabulated in\n`docs/reviews/2026-09-08-full-review.md`. Every new guard was verified by breaking it. The final\ntree passed the full gate against a PostgreSQL 17.11 container and the website build. No lifecycle\nstatus claim is made by this body.\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"story:provider-integrity-hardening"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"Eight review findings plus the blocker and nits two independent reviewers raised against the fixes, all corrected with regression tests","title":"Correct the findings of the 2026-09-08 full and independent reviews"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIGa652755120e4d24f11e299f213c5f32ad8314b060b44ae1a668fee3f0ecb796b","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":5,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIGa652755120e4d24f11e299f213c5f32ad8314b060b44ae1a668fee3f0ecb796b"]}]